ing a solo game you don't have to take on your enemies all by yourself. Recruit fighters to join your team - you never have to fight alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/25859fb9bb60268e8b80c08a7ed67dee.poster.avif?t=1751490916\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/25859fb9bb60268e8b80c08a7ed67dee.webm?t=1751490916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/25859fb9bb60268e8b80c08a7ed67dee.mp4?t=1751490916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Thrilling Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through four diverse districts, from neon-lit streets to gritty slums, crushing <strong>enemies</strong> and brutal bosses with fists or improvised weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/3437a2e827e2370568b22f758d2767dd.poster.avif?t=1751490916\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/3437a2e827e2370568b22f758d2767dd.webm?t=1751490916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/3437a2e827e2370568b22f758d2767dd.mp4?t=1751490916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Classic Side-Scrolling Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smash through enemies in vibrant 2D pixel art, with intuitive controls for any controller or keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/1c1e8f486098bde6363cecf6c60f0e53.poster.avif?t=1751490916\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/1c1e8f486098bde6363cecf6c60f0e53.webm?t=1751490916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/1c1e8f486098bde6363cecf6c60f0e53.mp4?t=1751490916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose Your Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way around the city or test your skills and go straight for the final boss - the choice is yours!<strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/ca7e905e843ddd9c70f73cbba2764a97.poster.avif?t=1751490916\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/ca7e905e843ddd9c70f73cbba2764a97.webm?t=1751490916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/ca7e905e843ddd9c70f73cbba2764a97.mp4?t=1751490916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the chaos of massive battles through the streets as you fight to reclaim them, solo or with your crew!<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132260/extras/9479e99937728f53e5b923b08d0d51da.avif?t=1751490916\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Eight Dragons 2: Fight alone. Fight together. Fight everybody!</i></p>",
